  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep veggies: Bring 1L (4 cups) water to the boil in a medium saucepan for the rice. Thinly slice the spring onion. Cut the Chinese broccoli into 3cm lengths, separating the stems and leaves. Trim the beans and cut into 1cm lengths. Crush or finely chop 1 garlic clove, peel and finely grate the ginger.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70392/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_01-3c5e09c19014ea60abcdf05ac61091d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Preheat the grill to high. Add the rice and a pinch of salt to the boiling water and cook for 25 mins or until tender. Drain. Meanwhile, whisk the garlic, ginger, 1 tbs honey and 2 tbs soy sauce in a small bowl to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70393/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_02-2926580d9bbc8c56d65fa9aea6b809f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill tofu: Remove the tofu according to the packet instructions and drain on paper towel. Cut into 2cm cubes, put in a shallow baking dish and pour over half the sauce. Grill for 8-10 mins until lightly golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70394/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_03-a49ec27f5bf99ddf4ba0511d16af9859.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir-fry veggies: Meanwhile, heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium deep frypan over medium-high heat. Stir-fry the spring onion, broccoli stems and beans for 3-4 mins until almost tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70395/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_04-bc759d4f4e2c78354fd94ba1a59b85a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the broccoli leaves and 1 tbs water and stir-fry for 1 min or until tender. Remove the pan from the heat, add the brown rice and remaining sauce and toss to combine. Divide the rice mixture among bowls and top with the tofu to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70396/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_05-5a7a1690f603c65ff6737795493d279d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen hack: This meal makes a mean leftover lunch - simply reheat or serve cool at room temperature.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/70397/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_HACK-4d24763fbe97269c0089cc30f420a7fa.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
